        "their names differ. "
        "Do not use a generic transcript feature or splice anchor as proof of a separately named biological "
        "feature, regulatory element, or site class when the user supplied only the name and did not define "
        "its mapping. Treat requested-target labels and feature "
        "names as identity evidence when they name such an element rather than merely describing "
        "window geometry. Do not use "
        "the selected feature itself as the unstated reference point that proves a separate relational "
        "exclusion, and do not resolve conflicting or underspecified identity evidence by silently "
