        "declared_program_target.notes as typed request evidence scoped to its record and audit every "
        "identity, substitution, nomenclature, or spatial exclusion stated there. Ordinal equality does "
        "not establish a separately asserted spatial or substitution relation. Return exactly one "
        "record_findings item for every supplied record_index, including records with no separate identity "
